* ================================================
* MICROFC-60035-SMT SiPM Equivalent Circuit Model
* With Temperature Dependence
* ================================================
*
* PARAMETERS:
*   ILOAD    = Average photocurrent (default: 2mA)
*   IDARK25  = Dark current at 25°C (default: 1µA)
*   CSIPM    = Internal capacitance (default: 3400pF)
*   RSERIES  = Series resistance (default: 100Ω)
*   VBR25    = Breakdown voltage at 25°C (default: 24.5V)
*   TCVBR    = Vbr temp coefficient (default: 21.5mV/°C)
*   TCGAIN   = Gain temp coefficient (default: -0.8%/°C)
*   TCDCR    = DCR doubling temperature (default: 10°C)
*
* TEMPERATURE:
*   Uses LTspice global TEMP variable
*   Set with: .temp 25 (or .step temp ...)
*
* USAGE:
*   XU1 CATHODE ANODE SIPM_60035_TEMP
*   XU1 CATHODE ANODE SIPM_60035_TEMP PARAMS: ILOAD=5m
*
* ================================================

.subckt SIPM_60035_TEMP CATHODE ANODE PARAMS:
+ ILOAD=2m
+ IDARK25=1u
+ CSIPM=3400p
+ RSERIES=100
+ VBR25=24.5
+ TCVBR=21.5m
+ TCGAIN=-0.008
+ TCDCR=10

* === TEMPERATURE-DEPENDENT PARAMETERS ===

* Breakdown voltage vs temperature
* VBR(T) = VBR25 + TCVBR * (T - 25)
.param VBR_T = {VBR25 + TCVBR * (TEMP - 25)}

* Gain vs temperature (relative to 25°C)
* GAIN(T) = 1 + TCGAIN * (T - 25)
.param GAIN_MULT = {1 + TCGAIN * (TEMP - 25)}

* Dark current vs temperature
* DCR doubles every TCDCR degrees
* IDARK(T) = IDARK25 * 2^((T - 25) / TCDCR)
.param IDARK_T = {IDARK25 * PWR(2, (TEMP - 25) / TCDCR)}

* === CIRCUIT ELEMENTS ===

* Internal capacitance (temperature independent)
C_SIPM CATHODE ANODE {CSIPM}

* Temperature-dependent dark current
* Scales with voltage and temperature
G_DARK CATHODE ANODE VALUE={IDARK_T * V(CATHODE,ANODE) / 29}

* Series resistance (slight temperature dependence)
* Increases ~0.4%/°C typical for silicon
R_SERIES CATHODE INT {RSERIES * (1 + 0.004 * (TEMP - 25))}

* Temperature-adjusted photocurrent
* Gain decreases at higher temperatures
G_PHOTO INT ANODE VALUE={ILOAD * GAIN_MULT}

* Convergence helper
R_CONV CATHODE ANODE 1000Meg

* === INFORMATION OUTPUTS ===
* These create measurable nodes for monitoring

* Effective breakdown voltage at current temperature
V_VBR_INFO VBR_INFO 0 DC {VBR_T}

* Effective dark current at current temperature
* (in µA for easier reading)
V_IDARK_INFO IDARK_INFO 0 DC {IDARK_T * 1Meg}

* Gain multiplier at current temperature
V_GAIN_INFO GAIN_INFO 0 DC {GAIN_MULT}

.ends SIPM_60035_TEMP